WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.101
SCENES OF DEVASTATION UNFOLDING
RIGHT NOW IN TURKEY AND SYRIA

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:04.771
AFTER WHAT IS BEING CALLED ONE
OF THE MOST POWERFUL EARTHQUAKE

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.741
TO HIT THE REGION IN A CENTURY.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.251
&gt;&gt; MORE THAN 1600 PEOPLE WERE
KILLED, AND THOUSANDS WERE

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:23.223
INJURED AFTER THE MASSIVE QUAKE
STRUCK TURKEY'S GAZIANTEP

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.757
PROVINCE EARLIER MONDAY
MORNING.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:27.994
IN A NUMBER OF PEOPLE STILL
BURIED UNDERNEATH THE BURIAL,

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.729
AND THAT NUMBER COULD RISE
DRAMATICALLY.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:36.402
&gt;&gt; WE DO NOT KNOW HOW FAR THE
NUMBER OF DEAD AND INJURED WILL

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.405
RISE, AS THE REMOVAL WORKS
CONTINUE WITH MANY BUILDINGS IN

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:41.441
THE QUAKE ZONE.
OUR HOPE IS THAT WE WILL

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:44.210
RECOVER FROM THIS DISASTER WITH
THE LEAST LOSS OF LIFE.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:50.350
&gt;&gt; RESCUE WORKERS FRANTICALLY
SEARCHING FOR SURVIVORS IN

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:55.188
BITTERLY COLD TEMPERATURES.
BUT EVEN AS THEY DO, MATER

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:58.224
SHOCKS ARE HITTING THE AREA.
CNN'S SCOTT MCLAIN IS FOLLOWING

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.260
DEVELOPMENTS, HE JOINS US HERE
IN LONDON WITH THE LATEST ON

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.730
THAT, AND THESE AFTERSHOCKS ARE
MASSIVE, AREN'T THEY?

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.067
&gt;&gt; YES, THE NUMBER OF
CHALLENGES HERE FOR RESCUE

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.503
WORKERS MAX JUST CONTINUES TO
MULTIPLY.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:14.307
THESE AFTERSHOCKS, UNDER ANY
OTHER CIRCUMSTANCE, HAD THERE

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:18.344
NOT BEEN A 7.8 OVERNIGHT, YOU
WOULD CALL THEM MASSIVE

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:21.414
EARTHQUAKES ON THEIR OWN.
SO YOU HAD THE 7.8, WHICH

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:25.151
HAPPENED AFTER 4:00 IN THE
MORNING, AND THEN JUST ABOUT

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:30.123
TWO AND A HALF HOURS AGO OR SO,
YOU HAD ANOTHER MAJOR, MAJOR

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:33.393
AFTERSHOCK THERE WAS A 7.5,
JUST TO PUT THAT INTO CONTEXT,

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:37.330
THAT IS THE STRONGEST
EARTHQUAKE, STRONGER EVEN THAN

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.401
THE LAST SUBSTANTIAL EARTHQUAKE
IN TURKEY, WHICH IS 1999.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:45.371
THAT WAS A SEVEN POINT, FOUR
AND THAT ONE KILLED 17,000

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:48.074
PEOPLE, LEFT HALF 1 MILLION
PEOPLE HOMELESS.

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:51.544
IT JUST GIVES YOU A SENSE OF
WHAT WE ARE UP AGAINST AS THESE

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:55.315
RESCUE WORKERS ARE BATTLING NOT
ONLY THE CONSTANT TREMORS AND

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:58.384
SMALLER EARTHQUAKES, BUT ALSO
THE RISK OF MAJOR AFTERSHOCKS

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:01.354
LIKE THIS ONE, PLUS THE COLD
WEATHER, PLUS THE SNOW.

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:05.325
I JUST WANT TO SHOW YOU A PIECE
OF VIDEO THAT WE HAVE GOTTEN

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:09.128
NOT LONG AGO FOR MALATYA.
THIS WAS FROM THE MOST RECENT

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:13.266
AFTERSHOCK THERE.
THIS IS A REPORTER WITH A

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:19.138
TURKISH CHANNEL CALLED A NEWS,
LIVE ON AIR, WHEN IT SEEMS LIKE

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:21.507
CLEARLY, THEY REALIZED THAT
THERE IS MORE SHAKING, THEY

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.576
HEAR THE SOUNDS, AND START
RUNNING.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.545
THAT'S WHY WE PLAY THE PIECE OF
VIDEO, AND I TRANSLATE WHAT THE

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:26.412
REPORTER SAYS.
WATCH.

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:31.417
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:54.941
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
&gt;&gt; THE SOUNDS THERE MAX ARE

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:58.177
ABSOLUTELY TERRIFYING THERE.
THE REPORTER HERE IS SAYING, AS

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:02.081
WE ARE GOING TO THE RUBBLE, THE
SEARCH AND RESCUE EFFORTS,

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.216
THERE ARE TWO CONSECUTIVE
AFTERSHOCKS IN THE LOUD NOISE

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:06.319
WITH THE BUILDING YOU ARE SEEN
THAT WAS BROUGHT DOWN TO EARTH,

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:09.289
THERE'S LOTS OF DEPTHS, THIS
LOCAL RESIDENT HERE IS COVERED

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:12.158
IN DUST.
SO SOME REALLY TERRIFYING

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.960
SCENES.
WE ALSO HAVE UPDATES ON THE

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.230
NUMBER OF KILLED AND INJURED,
MORE THAN 1000 NOW IN TURKEY

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.999
WHO HAVE BEEN KILLED ACQUAINTED
AUTHORITIES.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:24.804
MORE THAN 2800 BUILDINGS HAVE
BEEN DEMOLISHED.

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:26.872
HAVE COLLAPSED, AND SO YOU
IMAGINE WHAT HAPPENED THERE,

00:03:26.872 --> 00:03:29.675
YOU MENTIONED THAT EACH ONE OF
THESE SITES WHERE WE ARE SEEING

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:34.013
THE PICTURES, MULTIPLY THAT BY
2000 IT 800, AND YOU CAN

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:36.182
IMAGINE WHAT POTENTIALLY THE
DEATH TOLL IS GOING TO BE HERE,

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:41.821
ESPECIALLY SINCE THIS INITIAL
EARTHQUAKE TOOK PLACE

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.056
OVERNIGHT.
THEY'RE MORE THAN 7000 INJURED,

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:45.758
BUT PRESIDENT ERDOGAN MADE
CLEAR EARLIER TODAY THAT THEY

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.795
SIMPLY DON'T KNOW HOW MANY
PEOPLE MAY STILL BE TRAPPED

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:52.865
UNDERNEATH OF THE RUBBLE.
OBVIOUSLY, THERE IS AID COMING

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:56.402
IN FROM AROUND THE WORLD,
RESCUERS FROM AROUND THE WORLD,

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.304
AROUND THE COUNTRY TO TRY TO
GET THERE, BUT THESE THINGS

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:01.908
TAKE TIME, AND WITH THESE
BITTERLY COLD TEMPERATURES,

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:04.977
NOTHING CAN HAPPEN QUICKLY
ENOUGH GIVEN THAT OF COURSE IT

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:07.780
WOULD BE EXTREMELY DIFFICULT
FOR SOMEONE TO SURVIVE

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.951
UNDERNEATH THE RUBBLE.
VERY LIKELY BADLY INJURED IN

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:14.687
THESE KIND OF TEMPERATURES,
WHICH ARE RIGHT AROUND FREEZING,

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:17.056
FOR SIGNIFICANT PERIODS OF TIME,
MAX.

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:20.827
&gt;&gt; WE'LL JUST SEEING THAT THE
UK HAS BEEN ASKED BY THE

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:24.797
TURKISH GOVERNMENT FOR SEARCH
AND RESCUE TEAMS, AND THEY ARE

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:28.034
SENDING 76 PERSONNEL APPARENTLY,
BUT THEY ARE PARTICULARLY

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:30.670
LOOKING FOR SEISMIC LISTENING
DEVICES, CONCRETE CUTTING, AND

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:34.006
BREAKING EQUIPMENT.
THIS IS THE SORT OF KIT THAT

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:37.843
THEY NEED IN THE NEXT FEW HOURS
REALLY, DON'T THEY, AND WHERE

00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:39.145
THEY GET THOSE PEOPLE FROM OUT
UNDER THE RUBBLE.

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:43.850
&gt;&gt; THAT'S ABSOLUTELY RIGHT.
AND EVEN WHEN IT COMES TO MORE

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.920
BASIC THINGS LIKE THAT, LIKE
HEAVY MACHINERY TO TRY TO PICK

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.791
FOR SOME OF THE DEBRIS, IF IN
FACT THERE IS SOMEONE TRAPPED

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:53.493
THAT MAYBE THEY CAN GET TO,
THESE THINGS ARE READILY

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:58.064
AVAILABLE IN BIG CITIES LIKE
GAZIANTEP, WHICH HAS THE

00:04:58.064 --> 00:05:01.300
HIGHEST DEATH TOLL RIGHT NOW,
200 PEOPLE KILLED, OR AT LEAST

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.470
200 PEOPLE KILLED I SHOULD SAY,
BUT ONE OF THE CONCERNS IS THAT

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:08.107
A LOT OF THIS EQUIPMENT PERHAPS
IS NOT FOUND AS READILY

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:10.109
AVAILABLE IN SOME OF THESE
SMALLER TOWNS AND VILLAGES

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:14.213
CLOSER TO THE EPICENTER, WHICH
IS WHERE THE SEARCH AND RESCUE

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:16.749
EFFORTS ARE MUCH MORE
RUDIMENTARY THAN THEY ARE IN

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:18.451
THE BIG CITIES.
HOPEFULLY A LOT OF THESE TOWNS

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:21.320
OR VILLAGES DON'T HAVE THE KIND
OF HIGH-RISES THAT WE HAVE IN

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:25.425
SOME OF THE BIGGER CITIES, BUT
REMEMBER, 1999 WAS A REAL WAKE

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:28.494
UP CALL FOR TURKEY, AND THAT IS
WHEN THEY STARTED TO REALLY GET

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:32.265
SMART ON BUILDING CODES AND
MAKE SURE THAT ANY NEW BUILDS

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:36.169
WERE ACCORDING TO EARTHQUAKE
PROOFING STANDARDS, BUT IN THE

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:39.238
SMALLER TOWNS AND VILLAGES,
WHERE YOU HAVE OLDER BUILDINGS,

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:41.507
PERHAPS NOT UP TO THE SAME KIND
OF CODES, THAT IS WHERE THERE'S

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:44.444
PLENTY OF CONCERN THAT THE
DEATH TOLL COULD BE EVEN HIGHER,

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:47.547
AND WE JUST SIMPLY DON'T KNOW
ABOUT IT YET, BECAUSE THE

00:05:47.547 --> 00:05:51.851
MOBILE CONNECTIVITY OUT THERE
IT'S NOT GREAT AT THE MOMENT,

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.786
MAX.
&gt;&gt; OKAY SCOTT, THANK YOU.

00:05:53.786 --> 00:05:56.889
AND SYRIA, OFFICIALS SAID AT
LEAST 592 PEOPLE HAVE DIED IN

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:59.625
THE QUAKE.
SYRIA STATE NEWS AGENCY SAYS

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.929
MOST OF THE DAMAGE AND DEATHS
WERE IN AND AROUND ALEPPO NEAR

00:06:02.929 --> 00:06:04.931
SYRIA'S NORTHERN BORDER WITH
TURKEY.

00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:07.800
THERE ARE ALSO CASUALTIES
REPORTED IN OPPOSITION HELD

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:12.638
TERRITORY IN SYRIA'S NORTHWEST.
RESCUE CREWS ACROSS THE REGION

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:16.576
ARE DESPERATELY TRYING TO
SEARCH OR REACH THOSE STUCK

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:18.544
UNDER THE RUBBLE OF FALLEN
BUILDINGS.

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.646
EARLIER, THEY MAKE YOU PULL
THIS YOUNG BOY OUT FROM THE

00:06:20.646 --> 00:06:25.718
RUBBLE IN THE CITY OF IDLIB.
SALMA HAS BEEN MODELED --

00:06:25.718 --> 00:06:28.087
MONITORING ALL OF THE SYRIAN
MOVEMENTS.

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:33.226
SADLY, THEY HAVE EXPERIENCE,
GROUPS LIKE THE WHITE HOUSE

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:34.627
KNOW EXACTLY WHAT THEY'RE DOING
IN THESE SITUATIONS.

00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:37.763
&gt;&gt; THIS IS AN ABSOLUTELY
CATASTROPHIC EVENT FOR A

00:06:37.763 --> 00:06:39.866
COUNTRY THAT'S ALREADY BEEN
DEVASTATED BY MORE THAN A

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:41.901
DECADE OF WAR, MAX.
YOUR FROM A COLLEAGUE SCOTT

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:44.604
ABOUT HOW TURKISH AUTHORITIES
HAVE REALLY BEEN PREPARING FOR

00:06:44.604 --> 00:06:47.974
A HUGE EARTHQUAKE MOUNT FOR
NEARLY TWO DECADES.

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:50.042
THEY ARE TRYING TO BUILD UP
BILLING CODES, THEY'RE TRYING

00:06:50.042 --> 00:06:52.111
TO MAKE SURE THAT PEOPLE ARE
SAFE.

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:54.514
IN SYRIA, THE EXACT OPPOSITE
HAS BEEN HAPPENING.

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:56.816
THERE'S BEEN A CIVIL WAR THAT
IS LITERALLY RATTLED THE

00:06:56.816 --> 00:07:00.853
COUNTRY, DESTROYED ITS
INFRASTRUCTURE, TARGETED

00:07:00.853 --> 00:07:02.822
HOSPITALS AND CLINICS.
AND YOU HAVE TO REMEMBER THAT

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:06.559
THE CIVIL CONFLICT IS VERY MUCH
PLAYING OUT HERE ON THE GROUND

00:07:06.559 --> 00:07:09.795
AS THIS EARTHQUAKE HAPPENS IN
ITS AFTERMATH, YOU HAVE TWO

00:07:09.795 --> 00:07:11.163
DIFFERENT AUTHORITIES ON THE
GROUND.

00:07:11.163 --> 00:07:13.766
YOU HAVE THE REGIME CONTROLLED
AREAS, A GOVERNMENT CONTROLLED

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:17.603
AREAS, THEY RECEIVING HELP OF
COURSE FROM THE, MASKS AND

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:21.641
REBEL HELD AREAS NORTH LIKE
PLACES LIKE IDLIB, WHERE THEY

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:27.580
ARE ENTIRELY RELIANT ON REBEL
FORCES PROVIDING HELP,

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.615
VOLUNTEERS LIKE THE WHITE
HELMETS TO PULL PEOPLE OUT FROM

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:33.719
UNDER THE RUBBLE, BUT THESE
VOLUNTEERS, MASKS, THEY

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:36.756
THEMSELVES NEED HELP.
ONE OF THEM MADE IN APPEAL, AS

00:07:36.756 --> 00:07:39.191
