TAKE A LISTEN.

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:45.464
&gt;&gt; VERY DIFFICULT TEST FOR US,
WE NEED HELP, WE NEED THE

00:07:45.464 --> 00:07:48.334
INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY TO DO
SOMETHING TO HELP US TO SUPPORT

00:07:48.334 --> 00:07:51.337
US.
RIGHT NOW, IT IS A DISASTER.

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:55.107
WE HELP FROM EVERYONE TO SAVE
OUR PEOPLE.

00:07:55.107 --> 00:08:00.479
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN HEAR THE EMOTION IN
HIS VOICE THERE, MAX.

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:05.584
IT IS ABSOLUTELY A DESPERATE
AND DEVASTATING SITUATION FOR A

00:08:05.584 --> 00:08:08.588
